    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24918" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακείρω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διέκερσα</span> (v. infr.), prop. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cut through,</i>
			
