				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεῦρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					14.10
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή τις . . πειράτω
				διακέρσαι ἐμὸν ἔπος</span>
			<i>make it null, frustrate</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.8
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκευάρια διακεκαρμένος</span>
			<i>shorn of</i> his trappings, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1313
			</span></i>.</div>
